    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh, tú, ¿qué estás mirando?\nAquí no hay nada que ver.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002C0020007400FA002C002000BF0071007500E9002000650073007400E100730020006D006900720061006E0064006F003F000A00410071007500ED0020006E006F00200068006100790020006E00610064006100200071007500650020007600650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás mirando mi Holotransportador? Pues deja\nde mirar tanto si sabes lo que te conviene.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué estás mirando?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000650073007400E100730020006D006900720061006E0064006F003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Es que quieres usar mi Holotransportador?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073002000710075006500200071007500690065007200650073002000750073006100720020006D006900200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues te vas a quedar con las ganas, porque es\nde uso exclusivo de un servidor.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSe mira, pero no se toca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si tan empeñad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa estás en usarlo, tendrá que ser\npor las malas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530069002000740061006E00200065006D0070006500F10061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002000650073007400E1007300200065006E00200075007300610072006C006F002C002000740065006E0064007200E100200071007500650020007300650072000A0070006F00720020006C006100730020006D0061006C006100730021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres que te dé una paliza en un combate,\n¡ya sabes dónde encontrarme! Pero yo de ti me<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlo pensaría bien. ¡Avisad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa estás!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si te empeñas en usar mi Holotransportador,\n¡vas a tener que sufrir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074006500200065006D0070006500F10061007300200065006E002000750073006100720020006D006900200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072002C000A00A100760061007300200061002000740065006E00650072002000710075006500200073007500660072006900720021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a combatir!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F00730020006100200063006F006D0062006100740069007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira, da igual",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900720061002C00200064006100200069006700750061006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ja, vaya pringad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa! Anda, piérdete.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004A0061002C002000760061007900610020007000720069006E00670061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002100200041006E00640061002C00200070006900E900720064006500740065002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pfff, sí que tienes ganas de salir escaldad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa...\n¡Que conste que te avisé!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ayyy, cuánto lo siento! ¡Perdóname!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007900790079002C00200063007500E1006E0074006F0020006C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0021002000A1005000650072006400F3006E0061006D00650021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No tenía ni la menor idea de que eras tan fuerte!\n¡Te pido disculpas por faltarte al respeto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, no dudes en usar el Holotransportador\nsi lo necesitas. Lo mío es tuyo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÚsalo tantas veces como quieras.\nNada me haría más feliz, de verdad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tranquil<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, que yo me quedo aquí vigilando para\nque tengas el Holotransportador a tu disposición<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsiempre que te apetezca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este Holotransportador es de uso público,\npor supuesto. Utilízalo tanto como quieras.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
